Diagnostics (CONFIG_JZ_DIAG_LASTPANIC, default n): keep the last panic/oops/restart
location in registers that survive the WDT reset (CPM CPSPR, RTC RTCSAR,
CP0 EPC/EntryLo0/EntryLo1/EntryHi) and show it in /proc/diag_lastpanic.
T23/T31 only; no effect unless the option is enabled.

